---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Privacy — Rythero" description="How Rythero currently handles analytics, local audio tools and privacy." canonical="/privacy">
  <section class="section shell privacy-page">
    <div class="eyebrow">Privacy</div>
    <h1>Privacy, without the noise.</h1>
    <p class="lead">Rythero is currently a lightweight pre-launch website. There are no user accounts, newsletter forms, checkout flows or advertising systems on the site.</p>

    <div class="privacy-grid">
      <article class="card"><h2>Optional Google Analytics</h2><p class="muted">Google Analytics is blocked by default and is loaded only after you choose <strong>Accept</strong>. It is used to understand site usage and improve Rythero. Advertising storage and ad personalization remain disabled.</p></article>
      <article class="card"><h2>Cloudflare</h2><p class="muted">Rythero is delivered through Cloudflare and uses Cloudflare Web Analytics for privacy-focused traffic and performance measurement. Cloudflare states that Web Analytics does not use cookies, local storage or fingerprinting to track visitors.</p></article>
      <article class="card"><h2>Local audio tools</h2><p class="muted">The current Audio Analyzer and Signature Lab decode and measure selected audio files inside your browser. These tools do not upload the audio file to Rythero. Signature profiles may be stored locally in your browser so you can compare a later result; the audio itself is not stored by Rythero.</p></article>
      <article class="card"><h2>Your choice</h2><p class="muted">You can accept or reject optional analytics with equal access to the site. You can reopen the choice at any time using <strong>Cookie choices</strong> in the footer.</p></article>
      <article class="card"><h2>Cookies and local storage</h2><p class="muted">For details about Google Analytics cookies, durations and the local preference used to remember your choice, see the <a class="inline-link" href="/cookies">Cookie policy</a>.</p></article>
    </div>

    <div class="legal-note"><h2>Controller information still required</h2><p>This pre-launch notice is not the final legal privacy notice. Before Rythero is actively promoted as a public service, it must include the full legal identity and contact details of the data controller. That information is required even when Google Analytics is optional and consent-based.</p></div>
    <p class="note">Last updated: September 2026.</p>
  </section>
  <style>.privacy-page{max-width:920px}.privacy-page h1{font-size:clamp(2.7rem,6vw,5.5rem);line-height:.95;letter-spacing:-.055em;margin:14px 0 24px}.lead{max-width:760px;color:var(--muted);font-size:1.15rem}.privacy-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:14px;margin-top:34px}.privacy-grid h2{margin:0 0 8px;font-size:1.15rem}.inline-link{color:#91dba6;text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px}.legal-note{margin-top:26px;border:1px solid #4a3c25;border-radius:18px;padding:20px;background:#110e08}.legal-note h2{margin:0 0 8px;font-size:1rem;color:#e8d9af}.legal-note p{margin:0;color:#aaa18b;font-size:.9rem}.note{margin-top:28px;color:#738078;font-size:.85rem}</style>
</Base>
